	(text "Diagonal board D2 of 5 - letters D Q E R F S (6 letters, 12 jacks).\nLink net L_XY joins wire Y of letter X and wire X of letter Y on all four jacks of the two letters; S_X = own wire of letter X.\nJunction headers: 3 per boundary, ribbon pin n <-> pin n; links sorted by (X,Y) take connector (i // 64 + 1), pin i % 64 + 1.\nConnector 3 pins 61-64 = 0 V reference (GND), tied to every jack pins 27-29 and to the single power-0V terminal J0V (D1).\nShells and mounting holes = CHASSIS; CHASSIS - 0 V by 1 Mohm || 10 nF (R1, C1)."
